  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C034.signal_basis",
    "value": "Link account and schedule histories, record handling roles and information passed, document reported offline preparation, and inspect continuity and conflicts. Corroborated histories can reveal a recurring, actionable handoff problem eligible for one narrow change.",
    "scope": "A bounded cohort and a proposed diagnostic observation. Release suitability requires corroborated recurrence and actionability; internally consistent documentation alone does not establish truthful reporting or correct linkage.",
